id: 4
hanzi: 建筑
pinyin: jiàn zhù
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Noun

meanings_summary:
  en: building; architecture; to construct; to erect
  es: edificio; arquitectura; construir; edificar

senses[2]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Noun | Standard | a building, structure, or physical edifice erected on land | edificio, estructura o inmueble construido sobre el terreno | 风格独特的古代木质建筑 (ancient wooden buildings of unique style)
  2 | Verb | Standard | to build, construct, or engineer edifices or structures | diseñar, erigir o levantar construcciones arquitectónicas | 建筑防洪大坝 (construct a flood-control dam)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 漫步在万国建筑博览群的外滩沿岸，一幢幢巍峨耸立的欧式石砌建筑见证了上海百年的沧桑变迁。 | Mànbù zài wànguó jiànzhù bólǎnqún de Wàitān yán'àn, yí zhuàngzhuàng wēi'é sǒnglì de Ōushì shíqì jiànzhù jiànzhèng le Shànghǎi bǎinián de cāngsāng biànqiān. | Strolling along the Bund with its multinational architectural expo, towering European-style stone buildings bear witness to Shanghai's century of changes. | Paseando por el Bund frente a edificios de estilo europeo, las construcciones de piedra atestiguan un siglo de transformaciones en Shanghái.
  #2 | 现代建筑设计师越来越注重节能环保与低碳技术的应用，力争让每一座新建大楼都与城市自然生态融为一体。 | Xiàndài jiànzhù shèjìshī yuèláiyuè zhùzhòng jiénéng huánbǎo yǔ dītàn jìshù de yìngyòng, lìzhēng ràng měi yí zuò xīnjiàn dàlóu dōu yǔ chéngshì zìrán shēngtài róng wéi yītǐ. | Modern architects place increasing emphasis on eco-friendly efficiency and low-carbon tech, striving to harmonize every new tower with urban ecology. | Los arquitectos priorizan la eficiencia ecológica y tecnologías bajas en carbono, buscando integrar cada nuevo rascacielos en el ecosistema urbano.

